title: Start
---
Camera: Pans across Leo's room, showcasing his posters, bookshelves, etc
Camera: Zooms behind Leo, who is typing on his computer
Camera: Show Leo typing to his friend via online chat

Leo: You said you found something interesting?
Max: That's right~
Leo: Well, what is it?
Max: You might want to check this out...
Max: \[Click Link]

Camera: Zoom into screen, fade black, and zoom out into 2027 screen

Leo: W-what just happened...?
Leo: Huh? Jaycord? Everything looks so different...

???: *Knock knock!*

-> Exit

Camera: Shows door

Leo: Who's there?

Camera: Opens door, revealing a delivery box

Leo: Gift from Max...? What could be inside?

Camera: AI Companion Tool pops out from the box

Leo: H-huh?!

CrowGPT: Hey there, Leo! My name is CrowGPT, or Crow for short :)
CrowGPT: I'm your personal AI Companion Friend, ask me anything!

-> Who are you?
    CrowGPT: I'm an LLM, built to assist you with anything - whether it would be with daily tasks, persisting questions, or if you just need someone to listen.
    <<jump Intro1>>
-> Why are you a crow?
    CrowGPT: Well, that's just how I was designed. As an LLM, I can really take any form, but my developers thought this mascot would be the most unique and friendly :)
    <<jump Intro2>>

===

title: Intro1
---
-> What is an LLM?
    CrowGPT: An LLM, short for Large Langugae Model, is a type of artificial intelligence designed to understand, summarize, translate, and generate human-like text.
    <<jump Intro3>>

